OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly brightness across
OL,6,Fsouthern areas, otherwise generally
OL,7,Fcloudy with patchy light rain across
OL,8,Fthe region. Some heavier bursts,
OL,9,Fespecially in the afternoon. Winds
OL,10,Flight. Feeling mild in the south but
OL,11,Fcooler near some coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FTurning drier for a time,
OL,14,Fbefore a further band of heavier rain
OL,15,Farrives from the southwest. Some mist
OL,16,Fand a chance of fog forming. Winds
OL,17,Fremaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
