OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FMisty start with further
OL,6,Frain and drizzle affecting most areas.
OL,7,FPossibly turning drier later and winds
OL,8,Fremaining light.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,11,Flargely dry with some sunshine Friday
OL,12,Fand Saturday but a few coastal
OL,13,Fshowers. Temperatures near or below
OL,14,Fnormal. Mostly light winds. Cloudier
OL,15,Fwith rain likely later on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
